{"id":"f1e311cc01fd17ee","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-sharp-sat.md","title":"有限赋值计数与 #SAT","display":"df-sharp-sat — 有限赋值计数与 #SAT","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-sharp-sat","aliases":["28-df-sharp-sat"],"display":"df-sharp-sat — 有限赋值计数与 #SAT","depends_on":["[[28-df-sat]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 342,346,352–354","source_printed_pages":"342,346,352–354","source_pdf_pages":"368,372,378–380","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-sharp-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-sharp-sat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sharp-sat — 有限赋值计数与 #SAT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 342,346,352–354"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"342,346,352–354"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"368,372,378–380"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{CNFEval}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{CNFEval}\\)</span> 及有效单射编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。每个 CNF 是有限子句集，各文字是布尔公式。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a\">\\(\\widehat a\\)</span> 是下式对有限赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的零延拓；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\#\\mathrm{SAT}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 对非法编码也有值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Phi}\\ \\bigcup_{\\ell\\in C}\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell)\\qquad(\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Phi}\\ \\bigcup_{\\ell\\in C}\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell)\\qquad(\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\widehat a(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a(v)&amp;v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\\\0&amp;v\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a).\\end{cases}\\qquad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V_\\Phi},\\ \\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\widehat a(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a(v)&amp;v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\\\0&amp;v\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a).\\end{cases}\\qquad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V_\\Phi},\\ \\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\left|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V_\\Phi}:\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\widehat a}(\\Phi)=1\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\left|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V_\\Phi}:\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\widehat a}(\\Phi)=1\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}N(\\Phi)&amp;z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi),\\ \\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF},\\\\0&amp;z\\notin\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}[\\mathrm{CNF}].\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}N(\\Phi)&amp;z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi),\\ \\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF},\\\\0&amp;z\\notin\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}[\\mathrm{CNF}].\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{USAT}\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)=1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{OddSAT}\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{USAT}\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)=1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{OddSAT}\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第17章的 SAT 使用 CNF 表示，本条也固定该表示。只数实际出现变量的有限赋值，不能数整个无限 PropVar 上的延拓，否则每个可满足公式都有无限多赋值。零延拓仅用于调用现有全赋值求值接口，不改变有限公式真值。单射编码使分段单值且全定义；空CNF计数为1，含空子句的CNF计数为0。USAT在这里是计数等于1的语言，不自动等同于带“0或1个解”承诺的问题。</p>\n<p>来源：§17.1.1（印刷342 / PDF368）、Theorem17.10（印刷346 / PDF372）、Definitions17.15–17.16及§17.4.1（印刷352–354 / PDF378–380）。这些原文已读取；有限支持赋值、非法输入和编码层边界是本地显式补全。先查本目录SAT、#P、计数oracle及R3目录，原来没有定义#SAT的兼容节点，而Toda等结论已使用该名称，因此补建可复用接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{CNF},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{CNFEval}$ 及有效单射编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}$ 分别见 [[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。每个 CNF 是有限子句集，各文字是布尔公式。\n$\\widehat a$ 是下式对有限赋值 $a$ 的零延拓；$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$ 对非法编码也有值。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{CNF},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{CNFEval}$ 及有效单射编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}$ 分别见 [[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。每个 CNF 是有限子句集，各文字是布尔公式。\n$\\widehat a$ 是下式对有限赋值 $a$ 的零延拓；$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$ 对非法编码也有值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{CNFEval}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Phi}\\ \\bigcup_{\\ell\\in C}\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell)\\qquad(\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\widehat a(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a(v)&v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\\\0&v\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a).\\end{cases}\\qquad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V_\\Phi},\\ \\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF})","display":true},{"tex":"N(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\left|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V_\\Phi}:\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\widehat a}(\\Phi)=1\\}\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}N(\\Phi)&z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi),\\ \\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF},\\\\0&z\\notin\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}[\\mathrm{CNF}].\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{USAT}\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)=1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{OddSAT}\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:\\#\\mathrm{SAT}(z)\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2724,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计数复杂性与隔离引理：[[28-df-sharp-sat]]、[[28-df-counting-reduction]]、[[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]、[[28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat]]、[[28-thm-hash-isolation]]。"},{"id":"533a7b5c79de3204","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-sat]]；$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}$ 与 $\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-counting-reduction]]；图灵完全性见 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n采用 [[28-thm-cook-levin]] 的确定型验证计算编码；所有证书长度固定为 [[28-df-sharp-p]] 的 $p(|x|)$，不同证书不按计算前缀重复计数。"}],"outgoing":["4041cfa2975b8dd1","2eb3efc252f058f9"]}